	(text "Input: 2k/1k divider (x0.31 with the 10 k input) keeps the receiver's +-4.2 V worst case inside the 1.41 V peak full scale; 100 nF couples to the ADC's own bias (150 Hz high-pass)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 53.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "055d0e03-b7c0-559c-972e-9c010e58f9b9")
	)
	(text "Per channel, set at boot: CHx_INSRC = single-ended (01), CHx_IMP = 10 k (01), AC-coupled, fixed 0 dB gain, DRE and AGC OFF (they change gain on the fly and break channel matching)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1b4577a1-d1e1-5835-8bf7-f53e3b9f7866")
	)
	(text "ADC: TLV320ADC5140 (TI, 4 channels, up to 768 kSPS). Run at 192 kSPS: flat to about 86 kHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2765a67d-8ab2-548f-bcac-a47fbe55b656")
	)
	(text "TDM slave: BCLK 18.432 MHz, FSYNC 192 kHz from the FPGA (shared by all 16 ADCs, so all 64 channels sample at the same instant). 4 slots x 24 bits on SDOUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "34084682-4303-51e6-b9c4-d9cca326b84b")
	)
	(text "I2C: SCL shared, SDA per group of 4 ADCs; A1/A0 set the address 0x4C-0x4F inside the group. Config writes can use I2C broadcast (P0_R2 I2C_BRDCAST_EN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46d809cf-1bbb-559f-a0f5-ffaf1cf0df75")
	)
	(text "Also: ADC_FSCALE 2.75 V (1 Vrms single-ended full scale), AREG_SELECT = 1, TX_EDGE = 1 (the FPGA latches SDOUT one BCLK after launch)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56d74f47-a2fe-5351-a562-ae88331c2e89")
	)
	(text "Decoupling at the pins (datasheet Figure 172): AVDD 1 uF + 100 nF, AREG and DREG 10 uF + 100 nF, IOVDD 10 uF + 100 nF, VREF 1 uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7ad0d695-c563-5ae9-8646-3c91a9d8dab8")
	)
	(text "Channel inputs: 2k + 1k divider, 100 nF AC coupling (single-ended, INxM AC-grounded)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c037517-a074-5126-9cbe-d8109ef0d603")
	)
	(text "Power-up: SHDNZ (ADC_SHDNZ, pulled low on the header sheet) stays low until the rails settle, then wait 2 ms before I2C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d47b4f2a-b649-5edf-b150-88a8c53fd4ad")
	)
